problem:
Find all solutions of the system of equations in real numbers:

$$
\\begin{cases}
x^{3} - x + 1 = y^{2} \\\\
y^{3} - y + 1 = x^{2}
\\end{cases}
$$

Please reason step by step and use the python tool to solve the math problem.
Finally, Return only the verified final answer in \\boxed{}. Never guess.
